    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκελ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>urge on, cheer on</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κυσί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					9.7
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.20
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πολεμικὸν ἐγκελεύεσθαι</span>
			<i>sound</i> a charge, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arist.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in 
				Med.
			 also, <i>command</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς στραταγοῖς</span>”
