					<u>IPE</u>
					12.79.23
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Olbia</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Asp.
				<u>in EN</u>
				135.13
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i>enjoin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				104a
			</span></i>.</div>
